  "summary": "openapi-python-client: Malicious OpenAPI Documents can cause Arbitrary Code Generation",
  "details": "### Impact\nA malicious OpenAPI document processed by any `openapi-python-client` prior to 0.29.1 can generate arbitrary Python code. When anyone imports the malicious client, that arbitrary Python code will execute.\n\n### Patches\nVersions starting with 0.29.1 have updated with guardrails to prevent arbitrary code generation. Upgrade to this version immediately and audit any code previously generated from untrusted documents.\n\n### Workarounds\nDo not generate clients for documents you don't completely trust. Carefully verify any existing generated code from untrusted documents.",
